  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Let me back up. This is home.",
   "loc": "station_ext",
   "tod": "day",
   "wx": null,
   "z": null,
   "props": [
    "sign",
    "pumps"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "card": null
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Two pumps, zero gas, a roof that leaks, and a sign that lost half its letters.",
   "cam": 1.2,
   "camx": 0.3
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Inside, we've got canned beans, a radio that only plays static, and a cooler full of hope.",
   "loc": "station_int",
   "props": [
    "shelves",
    "radio",
    "cooler"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "And these are the people I'd die for. Hopefully not today.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.2:idle",
    "dooley:.38:idle",
    "pip:.55:idle",
    "tank:.78:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "That's Mags. She can fix an engine with a paperclip and a bad attitude.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.35:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.15,
   "camx": 0.35,
   "card": {
    "kind": "name",
    "title": "MAGS",
    "sub": "Mechanic. Fixes anything. Trusts no one."
   }
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "I heard that, Cole.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.35:point"
   ],
   "card": null
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Dooley's the oldest. Forty years in the army, and he still sleeps with his boots on.",
   "cast": [
    "dooley:.4:idle"
   ],
   "camx": 0.4,
   "card": {
    "kind": "name",
    "title": "DOOLEY",
    "sub": "Retired soldier. Never takes his boots off."
   }
  },
  {
   "sp": "dooley",
   "text": "Boots on means you're ready. Boots off means you're dinner.",
   "cast": [
    "dooley:.4:talk"
   ],
   "card": null
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Pip is twelve. Smartest person here. Don't tell the others.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.42:idle"
   ],
   "camx": 0.42,
   "card": {
    "kind": "name",
    "title": "PIP",
    "sub": "Age 12. The brains. Owner of Biscuit."
   }
  },
  {
   "sp": "pip",
   "text": "I can hear you too. And Biscuit says hi.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.42:cheer"
   ],
   "card": null,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "bark",
     0.85
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "And that's Tank. Six foot six, three hundred pounds, and scared of literally everything.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.45:idle"
   ],
   "camx": 0.45,
   "card": {
    "kind": "name",
    "title": "TANK",
    "sub": "Biggest guy in the county. Afraid of spiders, dark, and loud noises."
   }
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Is that a spider? Please tell me that's not a spider.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.45:scared"
   ],
   "card": null,
   "fx": [
    "shake"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "It was a raisin.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.45:idle"
   ],
   "fx": []
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Every morning starts the same. Mags checks the doors. Dooley checks the road. Pip checks the radio.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.2:idle",
    "dooley:.4:idle",
    "pip:.62:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "camx": 0.5
  },
  {
   "sp": "pip",
   "text": "Still nothing. Just static. Same as yesterday.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.62:talk"
   ],
   "cam": 1.15,
   "camx": 0.7,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "static",
     0.1
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "And Tank checks under every table. Twice.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.5:scared"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "camx": 0.5
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Dinner is the same every night too. Beans. Cold. Out of the can.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.2:sit",
    "dooley:.38:sit",
    "pip:.55:sit",
    "tank:.75:sit"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "I used to hate beans. Now I dream about beans. Is that weird? That feels weird.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.2:sit",
    "dooley:.38:sit",
    "pip:.55:sit",
    "tank:.75:talk"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Everything about you is weird, Tank. That's why we keep you.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.2:talk",
    "dooley:.38:sit",
    "pip:.55:sit",
    "tank:.75:sit"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "And Biscuit? Biscuit eats better than all of us. Nobody knows how. Nobody asks.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.5:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.25,
   "camx": 0.6,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "bark",
     0.7
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "But here's the truth. We're running out. Of food. Of water. Of time.",
   "cam": 1.0,
   "camx": 0.5,
   "cast": [],
   "props": [
    "shelves",
    "radio",
    "cooler"
   ],
   "intensity": 0.3
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Every week, there's more of them on the highway. And fewer of us anywhere else.",
   "loc": "road",
   "tod": "day",
   "props": [
    "cars"
   ],
   "z": {
    "n": 7,
    "x0": 1.1,
    "x1": 0.8,
    "depth": "far"
   },
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.6
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Forty one days, and we haven't seen another living person. Not one.",
   "loc": "station_ext",
   "props": [
    "sign",
    "pumps"
   ],
   "z": null,
   "cam": 1.15,
   "camx": 0.5
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Here's how this works. Every like on this episode becomes one supply point for us.",
   "cast": [
    "cole:.5:talk"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "hud": "supplies"
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "And the most liked comment decides what we do next. Build walls. Find food. Take in new survivors. Your call.",
   "hud": null
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "But first, we had a problem.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.25:idle",
    "dooley:.5:cough",
    "pip:.72:idle"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "cough",
     0.8
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "dooley",
   "text": "It's nothing. Just a tickle.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.25:idle",
    "dooley:.5:cough",
    "pip:.72:idle"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "cough",
     0.9
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "That's not a tickle. That cough has been getting worse for three days.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.25:point",
    "dooley:.5:idle",
    "pip:.72:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "pip",
   "text": "He needs medicine. The pharmacy in Bellwood still has some. I saw it on the map.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.25:idle",
    "dooley:.5:idle",
    "pip:.72:point"
   ],
   "props": [
    "shelves",
    "radio",
    "cooler",
    "map"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Bellwood was six miles away. Six miles of road we hadn't walked in weeks.",
   "props": [
    "shelves",
    "radio",
    "cooler",
    "map"
   ],
   "cam": 1.2,
   "camx": 0.75
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Six miles? Like, on foot? Through zombie land?",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.5:scared"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "props": [
    "shelves",
    "radio",
    "cooler"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Unless you've got a car that runs on fear, big guy.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.3:talk",
    "tank:.6:scared"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "dooley",
   "text": "I'll go. I'm the one who's sick. I'm not sending kids out for my medicine.",
   "cast": [
    "dooley:.5:talk"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "cough",
     0.95
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "You can barely walk to the door without coughing, Dooley. You're staying.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.3:point",
    "dooley:.55:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "pip",
   "text": "I'll go! I know the way. I have the map memorized.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.5:cheer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Absolutely not, Pip.",
   "cast": [
    "pip:.5:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "In the end, it was decided. Mags, because she can fix anything we break. Tank, because he can carry anything we find. And me, because somebody has to keep those two from killing each other.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.3:idle",
    "cole:.5:talk",
    "tank:.7:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Wait. When did I volunteer? I don't remember volunteering.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.6:scared"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Turns out Mags did have a car. Sort of.",
   "loc": "station_ext",
   "props": [
    "sign",
    "pumps",
    "truck:.6"
   ],
   "cast": [
    "mags:.35:point"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "reveal",
     0.6
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "She's ugly, she's loud, and she has exactly one quarter tank. Her name is Doris.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.35:talk"
   ],
   "cam": 1.15,
   "camx": 0.5
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "So that afternoon, Mags, Tank and I loaded up Doris and drove toward Bellwood.",
   "loc": "road",
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:drive"
   ],
   "cast": [],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "engine",
     0
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "",
   "text": "",
   "hold": 2.6,
   "card": {
    "kind": "chapter",
    "title": "Chapter 2",
    "sub": "The Supply Run"
   },
   "act": "The Supply Run",
   "intensity": 0.45,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "whoosh",
     0
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "The highway was a graveyard of cars. Doors open. Bags left behind. Nobody coming back for them.",
   "loc": "road",
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:drive"
   ],
   "card": null,
   "cam": 1.1,
   "camx": 0.4
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Okay. Okay. I'm fine. This is fine. Everything is totally fine.",
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:drive",
    "cab:tank"
   ],
   "cam": 1.3,
   "camx": 0.55
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Tank, you're breathing so loud they can hear you in Canada.",
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:drive",
    "cab:mags"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Halfway there, we passed a car with a note taped to the windshield.",
   "props": [
    "cars"
   ],
   "cast": [
    "mags:.45:idle",
    "tank:.62:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Went to Bellwood Fire Station. Safe zone. Food and water. Come find us.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.45:talk",
    "tank:.62:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.2,
   "camx": 0.5
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "The note was dated three weeks ago. Nobody had come back for that car either.",
   "cam": 1.0,
   "intensity": 0.55
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Mags kept the note. She didn't say anything. She just folded it up and put it in her pocket.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.45:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.2,
   "camx": 0.45
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "So, if there's a safe zone with food, why aren't we going there right now?",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:idle",
    "tank:.6:talk"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Because notes don't come with guarantees, Tank. Three weeks is a long time out here.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:talk",
    "tank:.6:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Then Doris made a sound no car should ever make.",
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:.55:smoke"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "sputter",
     0.5
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "No, no, no. Don't you dare quit on me now.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:scared"
   ],
   "props": [
    "cars",
    "truck:.55:smoke"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "We were two miles from Bellwood. On foot. With an hour of daylight left.",
   "tod": "dusk",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.35:run",
    "cole:.45:run",
    "tank:.6:run"
   ],
   "props": [
    "cars"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "steps",
     0
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Bellwood used to be a nice little town. Now it was quiet. Too quiet.",
   "loc": "town",
   "wx": "fog",
   "cast": [],
   "props": [],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "The pharmacy was right where Pip said it would be. Windows smashed, door hanging open.",
   "cam": 1.25,
   "camx": 0.6
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "We walked down the middle of Main Street. Past the diner. Past the bank. Past a phone booth with someone still inside it.",
   "z": {
    "n": 1,
    "x0": 0.3,
    "x1": 0.3,
    "depth": "far"
   },
   "cam": 1.05,
   "camx": 0.4,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.8
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Don't look at it. Don't look at it. Why are you looking at it?",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.5:scared",
    "mags:.3:idle"
   ],
   "z": null
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "It's stuck, Tank. It can't open the door. Just keep walking.",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.55:scared",
    "mags:.35:point"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Why is it always a creepy door? Why can't it ever be a nice door?",
   "cast": [
    "tank:.4:scared",
    "mags:.25:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.1,
   "camx": 0.45
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Inside, the shelves were nearly bare. But Mags found something behind the counter.",
   "loc": "pharmacy",
   "wx": null,
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:idle",
    "tank:.7:idle"
   ],
   "cam": 1.0
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Cough syrup. Antibiotics. Bandages. Jackpot.",
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:cheer",
    "tank:.7:idle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "That's when we heard it.",
   "intensity": 0.7,
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:scared",
    "tank:.7:scared"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.5
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "A groan. Low and slow. Coming from the back room.",
   "cam": 1.2,
   "camx": 0.85,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.3
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "tank",
   "text": "Please be a cat. Please be a really big cat.",
   "cam": 1.3,
   "camx": 0.7
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "It was not a cat.",
   "z": {
    "n": 1,
    "x0": 0.92,
    "x1": 0.85,
    "depth": "near",
    "tag": "GARY"
   },
   "cam": 1.1,
   "camx": 0.7,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.4
    ],
    [
     "sting",
     0.1
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "It was the pharmacist. Still wearing his name tag. Gary.",
   "cam": 1.35,
   "camx": 0.85
  },
  {
   "sp": "mags",
   "text": "Hi, Gary. We're just gonna take these and go. Nice and slow.",
   "cam": 1.0,
   "cast": [
    "mags:.4:point",
    "tank:.65:scared"
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Gary did not want us to go.",
   "z": {
    "n": 1,
    "x0": 0.85,
    "x1": 0.72,
    "depth": "near",
    "tag": "GARY"
   },
   "fx": [
    "shake"
   ],
   "sfx": [
    [
     "groan",
     0.2
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "sp": "cole",
   "text": "Tank screamed. A sound so high pitched, every dog in Bellwood started barking.",
